    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fleet stands ready under your command as you step into a vast galaxy teeming with rival factions, opportunities, and danger. Battle space pirates, navigate the tangled politics of stellar powers, trade across star systems, expand your fleet, and uncover secrets and treasures lost in the void. As your wealth and influence grow, so too will your power to shape the fate of the galaxy\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a Galactic Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stars await you. In this grand cosmic sandbox, write your own legend the way you see fit\u2014build fleets, dominate trade, carve out territory. But as you rise, a threat that could shake the entire galaxy begins to stir\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/4ca8e7d59fcc4f718116be6755541409.poster.avif?t=1750519434\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/4ca8e7d59fcc4f718116be6755541409.webm?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/4ca8e7d59fcc4f718116be6755541409.mp4?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reactive economy system models supply and demand across the galaxy. Every trade, every war shifts the economic balance. There\u2019s profit to be made\u2014for those smart enough to seize it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/f298144cf7d224dbb73349a579d9321a.poster.avif?t=1750519434\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/f298144cf7d224dbb73349a579d9321a.webm?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/f298144cf7d224dbb73349a579d9321a.mp4?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Bullet-Hell Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold across astronomical distances in dazzling displays of bullet-hell combat\u2014each clash a ballet of fire and motion in the dark void. Arm yourself with the finest equipment and skills, and shine on the battlefield like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/9045112a72c263a6840508eb2f269572.poster.avif?t=1750519434\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/9045112a72c263a6840508eb2f269572.webm?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/9045112a72c263a6840508eb2f269572.mp4?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Write Your Space Opera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command fleets in conflict, lead a faction to power, or rally the galaxy against an apocalyptic threat. Your strategic and tactical choices will determine the fate of star systems and the story that unfolds across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/36f7f3c1d03f00ebd9b1a1e13064eb8b.poster.avif?t=1750519434\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/36f7f3c1d03f00ebd9b1a1e13064eb8b.webm?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/36f7f3c1d03f00ebd9b1a1e13064eb8b.mp4?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fleet stands ready under your command as you step into a vast galaxy teeming with rival factions, opportunities, and danger. Battle space pirates, navigate the tangled politics of stellar powers, trade across star systems, expand your fleet, and uncover secrets and treasures lost in the void. As your wealth and influence grow, so too will your power to shape the fate of the galaxy\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a Galactic Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stars await you. In this grand cosmic sandbox, write your own legend the way you see fit\u2014build fleets, dominate trade, carve out territory. But as you rise, a threat that could shake the entire galaxy begins to stir\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/4ca8e7d59fcc4f718116be6755541409.poster.avif?t=1750519434\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/4ca8e7d59fcc4f718116be6755541409.webm?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/4ca8e7d59fcc4f718116be6755541409.mp4?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reactive economy system models supply and demand across the galaxy. Every trade, every war shifts the economic balance. There\u2019s profit to be made\u2014for those smart enough to seize it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/f298144cf7d224dbb73349a579d9321a.poster.avif?t=1750519434\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/f298144cf7d224dbb73349a579d9321a.webm?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/f298144cf7d224dbb73349a579d9321a.mp4?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Bullet-Hell Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles unfold across astronomical distances in dazzling displays of bullet-hell combat\u2014each clash a ballet of fire and motion in the dark void. Arm yourself with the finest equipment and skills, and shine on the battlefield like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/9045112a72c263a6840508eb2f269572.poster.avif?t=1750519434\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/9045112a72c263a6840508eb2f269572.webm?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/9045112a72c263a6840508eb2f269572.mp4?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Write Your Space Opera</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command fleets in conflict, lead a faction to power, or rally the galaxy against an apocalyptic threat. Your strategic and tactical choices will determine the fate of star systems and the story that unfolds across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/36f7f3c1d03f00ebd9b1a1e13064eb8b.poster.avif?t=1750519434\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/36f7f3c1d03f00ebd9b1a1e13064eb8b.webm?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187610/extras/36f7f3c1d03f00ebd9b1a1e13064eb8b.mp4?t=1750519434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
